a class="group flex gap-3.5 rounded-xl border p-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-500/25" style="border-color:rgba(55,65,81,0.4);background:rgba(17,24,39,0.5);box-shadow:0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)" href="/intel/iran-us-drone-centcom-mtt0khlq"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 rounded-lg overflow-hidden"><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Flag_of_Iran_%28official%29.svg/960px-Flag_of_Iran_%28official%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=api&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/></div><div class="flex flex-col flex-1 min-w-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0" style="background:#eab308;box-shadow:0 0 5px 1px #eab30860"></span><span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">NAVAL</span><span class="text-gray-700 text-[10px] ml-auto">2h ago</span></div><h4 class="text-sm font-mono font-bold text-gray-200 leading-snug line-clamp-2 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">Iran claims capture of U.S. underwater drone in CENTCOM area</h4><p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-1">3<!-- --> signals · <!-- -->Iran, United States</p></div></a><a class="group flex gap-3.5 rounded-xl border p-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-500/25" style="border-color:rgba(55,65,81,0.4);background:rgba(17,24,39,0.5);box-shadow:0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)" href="/intel/iran-anduril-uuv-hormuz-mtsuo7hh"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 rounded-lg overflow-hidden"><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Flag_of_Iran_%28official%29.svg/960px-Flag_of_Iran_%28official%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=api&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/></div><div class="flex flex-col flex-1 min-w-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0" style="background: