lute inset-0 z-10 transition-opacity duration-200 rounded opacity-0 pointer-events-none"><div class="rounded-md overflow-hidden border border-gray-700/40 flex items-center justify-center" style="position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;background:#060c16"><span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-gray-600">locating…</span></div></div><div class="transition-opacity duration-200 opacity-100"><a href="https://x.com/osinttechnical/status/2097351918444056982" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Open original tweet on X" class="absolute top-2 right-2 p-1 rounded hover:bg-gray-700/40 text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors"><img alt="X logo" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-4 h-4" style="color:transparent" src="/logo.svg"/></a><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2"><img src="/avatars/osinttechnical-32.webp" alt="osinttechnical profile picture" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 object-cover"/><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="text-sm text-white font-semibold truncate">osinttechnical</div></div><div class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">15:50<!-- -->Z</div></div></div><div class="text-sm text-white leading-relaxed pl-11" data-no-translate="true" translate="no">Iranian forces claim to have captured an American Anduril Dive-LD Autonomous Undersea Vehicle near the Strait of Hormuz today. 

Comes as the US works to clear the strait of underwater mines.</div></div></button></div></div><div class="jsx-4cab224acf41c6fc overflow-y-auto pr-0 flex-1 lg:flex-none min-h-0"><div class="jsx-4cab224acf41c6fc text-xs text-gray-500 font-mono">Select a tweet to view mapped markets</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-black text-white font-mono"><div class="hidden lg:block"></div><div id="history-section" class="border-t border-gray-800"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 lg:py-16"><div class="mb-8 sm:mb-12 text-center"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 mb-3 sm:mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-archive w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 text-blue-400" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="5" x="2" y="3" rx="1"></rect><path d="M4 8v11a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8"></path><path d="M10 12h4"></path></svg><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-wider">PIZZA INTELLIGENCE HISTORY</h2></div><div class="w-16 sm:w-24 h-1 bg-blue-500 mx-auto mb-3 sm:mb-4"></div><p class="text-gray-400 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed px-4">How pizza delivery patterns became a window into military operations and global events.</p><button class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 text-sm flex items-center gap-1 mx-auto transition-colors">↑ RETURN TO LIVE DATA</button></div><div class="space-y-6 sm:space-y-8"><div class="mb-6 sm:mb-8"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 text-xs text-gray-500"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-red-500 rounded-full flex-shrink-0"></div><span class="font-mono">1970s-80s</span></div><div class="hidden sm:block w-8 h-px bg-gray-600"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-yellow-500 rounded-full flex-shrink-0"></div><span class="font-mono">1980s-90s</span></div><div class="hidden sm:block w-8 h-px bg-gray-600"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-green-500 rounded-full flex-shrink-0"></div><span class="font-mono">1990-91</span></div><div class="hidden sm:block w-8 h-px bg-gray-600"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-purple-500 rounded-full flex-shrink-0"></div><span class="font-mono">2020s</span></div><div class="hidden sm:block w-8 h-px bg-gray-600"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full flex-shrink-0"></div><span class="font-mono">2024-25</span></div></div></div><div class="bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6"><div class="bg-red-900/50 border border-red-500 rounded-full p-3 sm:p-4 flex-shrink-0 self-start sm:mt-1"><span class="text-red-400 font-bold text-sm font-mono">1970s</span></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-6"><div><h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-red-400 mb-3 sm:mb-4 leading-tight">1970s-1980s: SOVIET &quot;PIZZINT&quot; DOCTRINE</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">Soviet intelligence operatives develop unconventional surveillance methodology targeting Washington D.C.&#x27;s late-night food delivery patterns. KGB codename: <span class="text-yellow-400 font-mono font-bold bg-yellow-400/10 px-2 py-1 rounded">&quot;PIZZINT&quot;</span> (Pizza Intelligence).</p></div><div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-start"><div class="sm:col-span-2 order-2 sm:order-1 space-y-4"><div class="bg-black/40 border-l-4 border-red-500 pl-4 sm:pl-6 py-3 sm:py-4 rounded-r-lg"><div class="text-xs text-red-400 font-mono mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">Operational Logic:</div><p class="text-red-300 italic text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">&quot;If lights were burning late at the Pentagon or CIA, and delivery couriers were hauling stacks of pizzas through the door, something big might be brewing behind closed doors.&quot;</p></div><div class="bg-black/40 border-l-4 border-red-500 pl-4 sm:pl-6 py-3 sm:py-4 rounded-r-lg"><div class="text-xs text-red-400 font-mono mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">Strategic Rationale:</div><p class="text-red-300 italic text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">&quot;When U.S. military and intelligence staff worked late into the night during emergencies, they would order large quantities of food—especially pizza—since it is quick and convenient. A spike in pizza orders could signal that something significant was happening behind closed doors.&quot;</p></div></div><div class="order-1 sm:order-2 mb-4 sm:mb-0"><div class="bg-red-900/20 border border-red-500/30 rounded-xl p-3 sm:p-4 backdrop-blur-sm"><img alt="Soviet PIZZINT Intelligence Operation Illustration" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg border border-red-500/20" style="color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 33vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fsoviet-pizzint-illustration.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fsoviet-pizzint-illustration.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fsoviet-pizzint-illustration.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fsoviet-pizzint-illustration.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fsoviet-pizzint-illustration.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fsoviet-pizzint-illustration.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fsoviet-pizzint-illustration.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fsoviet-pizzint-illustration.webp&amp;w=2560&amp;q=75 2560w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fsoviet-pizzint-illustration.webp&amp;w=2560&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:hidden"></div><div class="bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6"><div class="bg-yellow-900/50 border border-yellow-500 rounded-full p-3 sm:p-4 flex-shrink-0 self-start sm:mt-1"><span class="text-yellow-400 font-bold text-sm font-mono">1983</span></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-6"><div><h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-400 mb-3 sm:mb-4 leading-tight">1983-1989: PATTERN VALIDATION PHASE</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">Local pizza delivery drivers began noticing they could anticipate &quot;big news&quot; 72 hours in advance by upticks in orders to government buildings. The pattern held across multiple military operations, as documented by <a href="https://time.com/archive/6715614/and-bomb-the-anchovies/" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline font-semibold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TIME magazine in 1990</a>.</p></div><div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-start"><div class="sm:col-span-2 order-2 sm:order-1 space-y-4"><div class="bg-black/40 border-l-4 border-yellow-500 pl-4 sm:pl-6 py-3 sm:py-4 rounded-r-lg"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 sm:mb-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-yellow-400 rounded-full flex-shrink-0"></span><span class="text-yellow-300 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Original Testimony</span></div><p class="text-yellow-200 italic text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-2 sm:mb-3">&quot;We know. Absolutely. Pentagon orders doubled up the night before the Panama attack; same thing happened before the Grenada invasion. Last Wednesday, we got a lot of orders, starting around midnight. We figured something was up.&quot;</p><div class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">— Domino&#x27;s Pizza Runner, TIME Magazine, August 13, 1990</div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-4"><div class="bg-black/40 border border-yellow-600/50 rounded-lg p-3 sm:p-4"><h4 class="text-yellow-300 font-bold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm sm:text-base"><span class="text-green-400 text-base sm:text-lg">✓</span> GRENADA (1983)</h4><p class="text-gray-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">Pentagon orders doubled the night before Operation Urgent Fury</p></div><div class="bg-black/40 border border-yellow-600/50 rounded-lg p-3 sm:p-4"><h4 class="text-yellow-300 font-bold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm sm:text-base"><span class="text-green-400 text-base sm:text-lg">✓</span> PANAMA (1989)</h4><p class="text-gray-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">Same pattern observed before Operation Just Cause</p></div></div></div><div class="order-1 sm:order-2 mb-4 sm:mb-0"><div class="bg-yellow-900/20 border border-yellow-500/30 rounded-xl p-3 sm:p-4 backdrop-blur-sm"><img alt="Pattern Validation Intelligence Operation - Grenada and Panama" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg border border-yellow-500/20" style="color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 33vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fpattern-validation-illustration.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fpattern-validation-illustration.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fpattern-validation-illustration.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fpattern-validation-illustration.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fpattern-validation-illustration.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fpattern-validation-illustration.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fpattern-validation-illustration.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fpattern-validation-illustration.webp&amp;w=2560&amp;q=75 2560w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fpattern-validation-illustration.webp&amp;w=2560&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6"><div class="bg-green-900/50 border border-green-500 rounded-full p-3 sm:p-4 flex-shrink-0 self-start sm:mt-1"><span class="text-green-400 font-bold text-sm font-mono">AUG &#x27;90</span></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-6"><div><h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-3 sm:mb-4 leading-tight">AUG 1990 - JAN 1991: GULF WAR DOCUMENTATION</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">The most celebrated case came during the Gulf Crisis. <span class="text-green-400 font-semibold">Frank Meeks</span>, owner of 43 D.C. Domino&#x27;s franchises, <a href="https://www.fastcompany.com/91352935/pentagon-pizza-index-the-theory-that-surging-pizza-orders-signal-global-crises" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline font-semibold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">documented unprecedented late-night deliveries</a> as U.S. forces prepared to expel Iraqi troops from Kuwait.</p></div><div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-start"><div class="sm:col-span-2 order-2 sm:order-1 space-y-4"><div class="bg-black/40 border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-4 sm:pl-6 py-3 sm:py-4 rounded-r-lg"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 sm:mb-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-400 rounded-full flex-shrink-0"></span><span class="text-green-300 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Recorded Data</span><a href="https://www.latimes.com/archives/la-xpm-1991-01-16-mn-374-story.html" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline text-xs ml-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">(source)</a></div><div class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3"><span class="text-yellow-400 font-mono font-bold bg-yellow-400/10 px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs sm:text-sm">101 pizzas</span><span class="text-gray-300 text-xs sm:text-sm">delivered to Pentagon on Jan 15, 1991</span></div><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3"><span class="text-yellow-400 font-mono font-bold bg-yellow-400/10 px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs sm:text-sm">21 pizzas</span><span class="text-gray-300 text-xs sm:text-sm">to CIA on Aug 1, 1990 (night before Kuwait invasion)</span></div><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3"><span class="text-red-400 font-mono font-bold bg-red-400/10 px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs sm:text-sm">3 → 100+</span><span class="text-gray-300 text-xs sm:text-sm">Pentagon orders jumped in 8 days</span></div></div></div><div class="bg-blue-900/20 border border-blue-500/40 rounded-lg p-3 sm:p-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 bg-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1"><span class="text-white font-bold text-xs">CNN</span></div><div><div class="text-blue-300 font-bold mb-1 text-sm sm:text-base">Wolf Blitzer, CNN Pentagon Correspondent</div><p class="text-blue-200 italic leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">&quot;Bottom line for journalists: Always monitor the pizzas.&quot;</p></div></div></div></div><div class="order-1 sm:order-2 mb-4 sm:mb-0"><div class="bg-green-900/20 border border-green-500/30 rounded-xl p-3 sm:p-4 backdrop-blur-sm"><img alt="Gulf War Pizza Intelligence Documentation - Pentagon and Kuwait Operations" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg border border-green-500/20" style="color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 33vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fgulf-war-illustration.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgulf-war-illustration.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgulf-war-illustration.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgulf-war-illustration.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgulf-war-illustration.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgulf-war-illustration.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgulf-war-illustration.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgulf-war-illustration.webp&amp;w=2560&amp;q=75 2560w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fgulf-war-illustration.webp&amp;w=2560&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:hidden"></div><div class="bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6"><div class="bg-purple-900/50 border border-purple-500 rounded-full p-3 sm:p-4 flex-shrink-0 self-start sm:mt-1"><span class="text-purple-400 font-bold text-sm font-mono">2023</span></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-6"><div><h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-purple-400 mb-3 sm:mb-4 leading-tight">2023-2024: DIGITAL RENAISSANCE</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">With Google Maps &quot;Popular Times&quot; showing live customer traffic, digital sleuths realized they could virtually monitor Pentagon-area pizzerias in real time. The Pizza Index exploded across social media during the 2023-24 Israel-Hamas conflict.</p></div><div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-start"><div class="sm:col-span-2 order-2 sm:order-1 space-y-4"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-4"><div class="bg-black/40 border border-purple-600/50 rounded-lg p-3 sm:p-4"><h4 class="text-purple-300 font-bold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm sm:text-base"><span class="text-lg sm:text-xl">📱</span> APRIL 13, 2024</h4><p class="text-gray-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">Iran launches drones → Papa John&#x27;s shows &quot;Busier than usual&quot; → Viral on X/Twitter</p></div><div class="bg-black/40 border border-purple-600/50 rounded-lg p-3 sm:p-4"><h4 class="text-purple-300 font-bold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm sm:text-base"><span class="text-lg sm:text-xl">🚀</span> JUNE 12, 2025</h4><p class="text-gray-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">@PenPizzaReport detects surge at 6:59 PM → Israel strikes Iran at 7:00 PM. <a href="https://www.foxnews.com/food-drink/how-papa-johns-pizza-surge-near-pentagon-tipped-off-social-media-before-trumps-decisive-iran-strike" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline font-semibold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FOX News coverage</a> detailed the pizza tracking phenomenon.</p></div></div><div class="bg-purple-900/20 border border-purple-500/40 rounded-lg p-3 sm:p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-purple-400 rounded-full flex-shrink-0"></div><span class="text-purple-300 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Digital Innovation</span></div><p class="text-gray-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">Real-time Google Maps data transforms pizza delivery monitoring from physical surveillance to virtual intelligence gathering.</p></div></div><div class="order-1 sm:order-2 mb-4 sm:mb-0"><div class="bg-purple-900/20 border border-purple-500/30 rounded-xl p-3 sm:p-4 backdrop-blur-sm"><img alt="Digital Renaissance - OSINT Pizza Intelligence Workstation" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg border border-purple-500/20" style="color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 33vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fdigital-renaissance-illustration-2.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdigital-renaissance-illustration-2.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdigital-renaissance-illustration-2.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdigital-renaissance-illustration-2.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdigital-renaissance-illustration-2.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdigital-renaissance-illustration-2.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdigital-renaissance-illustration-2.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdigital-renaissance-illustration-2.webp&amp;w=2560&amp;q=75 2560w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fdigital-renaissance-illustration-2.webp&amp;w=2560&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hidden lg:block"></div><div class="bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6"><div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-500 rounded-full p-3 sm:p-4 flex-shrink-0 self-start sm:mt-1"><span class="text-slate-400 font-bold text-sm font-mono">JUN &#x27;25</span></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-6"><div><h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-400 mb-3 sm:mb-4 leading-tight">JUNE 2025: OFFICIAL RESPONSE</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">Pentagon officials have consistently dismissed the pizza theory, emphasizing both the lack of correlation between pizza order spikes and military events and the abundance of food options within the Pentagon itself. The theory has gained renewed attention through <a href="https://www.foxbusiness.com/politics/pentagon-pizza-theory-resurfaces-during-israel-iran-conflict-social-media-tracks-orders" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline font-semibold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">extensive media coverage</a> during recent geopolitical events.</p></div><div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-start"><div class="sm:col-span-2 order-2 sm:order-1"><div class="bg-slate-900/20 border border-slate-500/40 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 sm:gap-4"><div class="w-8 h-8 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 bg-slate-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1"><span class="text-slate-300 font-bold text-xs">DOD</span></div><div><h4 class="text-slate-300 font-bold mb-2 sm:mb-3 text-sm sm:text-base">Department of Defense Statement</h4><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">When reached for comment on the Pentagon Pizza Report&#x27;s June 12 post and the pizza theory, the Department of Defense (DOD) told FOX Business it has <span class="text-red-400 font-semibold">&quot;nothing to offer&quot;</span> on the matter.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="order-1 sm:order-2 mb-4 sm:mb-0"><div class="bg-slate-900/20 border border-slate-500/30 rounded-xl p-3 sm:p-4 backdrop-blur-sm"><img alt="Pentagon Official Response - No Correlation Detected" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg border border-slate-500/20" style="color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 33vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%2025%2C%202025%2C%2010_32_38%20PM.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%2025%2C%202025%2C%2010_32_38%20PM.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%2025%2C%202025%2C%2010_32_38%20PM.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%2025%2C%202025%2C%2010_32_38%20PM.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%2025%2C%202025%2C%2010_32_38%20PM.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%2025%2C%202025%2C%2010_32_38%20PM.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%2025%2C%202025%2C%2010_32_38%20PM.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%2025%2C%202025%2C%2010_32_38%20PM.webp&amp;w=2560&amp;q=75 2560w" src="/_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%2025%2C%202025%2C%2010_32_38%20PM.webp&amp;w=2560&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6"><div class="bg-pink-900/50 border border-pink-500 rounded-full p-3 sm:p-4 flex-shrink-0 self-start sm:mt-1"><span class="text-pink-400 font-bold text-sm font-mono">2025</span></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-6"><div><h3 id="gay-bar-theory-section" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-pink-400 mb-3 sm:mb-4 leading-tight">2025: GAY BAR REPORT THEORY</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">The Pentagon Pizza Index expanded beyond pizza monitoring to include gay bars near sensitive government facilities. The theory suggests that unusually quiet activity at LGBTQ+ establishments during peak hours may indicate personnel working overtime on classified operations, as military and intelligence staff avoid public venues during high-tempo periods.</p><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4"><a href="https://www.queerty.com/this-iconic-gay-bar-near-the-pentagon-is-being-used-to-track-military-activity-in-the-middle-east-20250617/" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline font-semibold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Queerty reported</a> on how this iconic gay bar near the Pentagon became part of open-source intelligence tracking, with observers noting correlations between quiet nights at establishments like Freddie&#x27;s Beach Bar and subsequent military developments in the Middle East.</p></div><div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-start"><div class="sm:col-span-2 order-2 sm:order-1"><div class="bg-pink-900/20 border border-pink-500/40 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 sm:gap-4"><div class="w-8 h-8 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 bg-pink-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1"><span class="text-pink-300 font-bold text-xs">🏳️‍🌈</span></div><div><h4 class="text-pink-300 font-bold mb-2 sm:mb-3 text-sm sm:text-base">Inverse Activity Correlation</h4><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-3">The gay bar theory operates on an inverse correlation principle: when establishments that typically see consistent evening traffic suddenly become quiet, it may signal that government personnel are working extended hours on sensitive matters.</p><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">Observers track venues like <span class="text-pink-400 font-semibold">Freddie&#x27;s Beach Bar (1.4 mi from Pentagon)</span> and <span class="text-pink-400 font-semibold">The Little Gay Pub (1.1 mi from White House)</span>, monitoring for unusual dips in activity that coincide with geopolitical tensions.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="order-1 sm:order-2 mb-4 sm:mb-0"><div class="bg-pink-900/20 border border-pink-500/30 rounded-xl p-3 sm:p-4 backdrop-blur-sm"><img alt="Gay Bar Intelligence Monitoring - OSINT Activity Tracking" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg border border-pink-500/20" style="color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 33vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Sep%2011%2C%202025%2C%2003_16_42%20PM.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Sep%2011%2C%202025%2C%2003_16_42%20PM.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Sep%2011%2C%202025%2C%2003_16_42%20PM.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Sep%2011%2C%202025%2C%2003_16_42%20PM.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Sep%2011%2C%202025%2C%2003_16_42%20PM.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Sep%2011%2C%202025%2C%2003_16_42%20PM.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Sep%2011%2C%202025%2C%2003_16_42%20PM.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Sep%2011%2C%202025%2C%2003_16_42%20PM.webp&amp;w=2560&amp;q=75 2560w" src="/_next/image?url=%2FChatGPT%20Image%20Sep%2011%2C%202025%2C%2003_16_42%20PM.webp&amp;w=2560&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6"><div class="bg-fuchsia-900/50 border border-fuchsia-500 rounded-full p-3 sm:p-4 flex-shrink-0 self-start sm:mt-1"><span class="text-fuchsia-300 font-bold text-sm font-mono">2026</span></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-6"><div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-start"><div class="sm:col-span-2 order-2 sm:order-1"><h3 id="gentlemens-dispatch-theory-section" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-fuchsia-300 mb-3 sm:mb-4 leading-tight">2026: GENTLEMEN&#x27;S DISPATCH THEORY</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">Gentlemen&#x27;s Dispatch extends the same open-source pattern logic to strip-club activity around military communities. The premise is simple: unusual nightlife swings can act as an early signal of deployment tempo and readiness changes.</p><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed">A recent <a href="https://nypost.com/2026/03/30/media/stripper-charm-daze-reveals-us-troops-are-blowing-opsec-about-deployments/" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline font-semibold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York Post report</a> describes troops discussing upcoming deployments with a dancer, adding public anecdotal evidence to the broader OPSEC-signal conversation.</p></div><div class="order-1 sm:order-2 mb-4 sm:mb-0"><div class="bg-fuchsia-900/20 border border-fuchsia-500/30 rounded-xl p-3 sm:p-4 backdrop-blur-sm"><img alt="Gentlemen&#x27;s Dispatch theory illustration" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg border border-fuchsia-500/20" style="color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 33vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fcabaret-dispatch-history.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fcabaret-dispatch-history.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fcabaret-dispatch-history.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fcabaret-dispatch-history.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fcabaret-dispatch-history.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fcabaret-dispatch-history.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fcabaret-dispatch-history.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fcabaret-dispatch-history.png&amp;w=2560&amp;q=75 2560w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fcabaret-dispatch-history.png&amp;w=2560&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:hidden"></div><div id="faq-section" class="border-t border-gray-800"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 lg:py-16"><div class="mb-8 sm:mb-12 text-center"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 mb-3 sm:mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 text-yellow-300" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-wider">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h2></div><div class="w-16 sm:w-24 h-1 bg-yellow-400 mx-auto"></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-3 sm:space-y-4"><details class="group bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg overflow-hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 cursor-pointer select-none px-3 sm:px-4 py-3 sm:py-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 text-yellow-300">Q</span><h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold tracking-wide">What is the Pentagon Pizza Index (PizzINT)?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 text-gray-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-3 sm:px-4 pb-4 sm:pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base"><div><span class="text-gray-300">The Pentagon Pizza Index (PizzINT) is a real-time <span class="font-semibold">Pentagon pizza tracker</span> that visualizes unusual activity at Pentagon-area pizzerias. It highlights a signal that has historically aligned with late-night, high-tempo operations and breaking news. Explore our full platform: <a href="/electionhub" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline">Election Hub</a> for live prediction market odds, <a href="/polyglobe" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline">Polyglobe</a> for global market intelligence, or learn more on our <a href="/about" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline">About</a> page.</span></div></div></details><details class="group bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg overflow-hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 cursor-pointer select-none px-3 sm:px-4 py-3 sm:py-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 text-yellow-300">Q</span><h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold tracking-wide">Is the Pentagon Pizza Theory real or accurate?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 text-gray-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-3 sm:px-4 pb-4 sm:pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base"><div><span class="text-gray-300">It's an <span class="font-semibold">OSINT signal</span> supported by historical anecdotes and modern traffic data. Spikes frequently coincide with elevated watch or major news. Like any single indicator, it's best read in context with other signals.</span></div></div></details><details class="group bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg overflow-hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 cursor-pointer select-none px-3 sm:px-4 py-3 sm:py-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 text-yellow-300">Q</span><h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold tracking-wide">How do I read the dashboard and DOUGHCON levels?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 text-gray-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-3 sm:px-4 pb-4 sm:pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base"><div><span class="text-gray-300">Watch the <span class="font-semibold">DOUGHCON display</span>, active spikes, and the overall index. Look for "<span class="font-semibold">Busier than usual</span>" patterns, <span class="font-semibold">sustained late-night activity</span>, and multi-location surges — these tend to be higher-signal.</span></div></div></details><details class="group bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg overflow-hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 cursor-pointer select-none px-3 sm:px-4 py-3 sm:py-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 text-yellow-300">Q</span><h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold tracking-wide">What data sources does PizzINT use and how often is it updated?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 text-gray-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-3 sm:px-4 pb-4 sm:pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base"><div><span class="text-gray-300">We use public signals such as <span class="font-semibold">Google Maps Popular Times</span> and compare them to historical baselines. Data typically updates about every ~10 minutes. Currently tracking <span class="font-semibold">6 locations</span>. See more in <a href="/privacy" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline">Privacy</a>.</span></div></div></details><details class="group bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg overflow-hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 cursor-pointer select-none px-3 sm:px-4 py-3 sm:py-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 text-yellow-300">Q</span><h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold tracking-wide">How can I cite, embed, or support PizzINT?</h3></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 text-gray-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-3 sm:px-4 pb-4 sm:pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base"><div><span class="text-gray-300">Please cite <span class="font-semibold">PizzINT.watch</span>. For media or research inquiries, email <a href="mailto:ads.pizzint@gmail.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline">ads.pizzint@gmail.com</a>. If this project helps you, <a href="https://ko-fi.com/pizzintwatch" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-yellow-400 hover:text-yellow-300 underline">consider buying us a slice</a>.</span></div></div></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the Pentagon Pizza Index (PizzINT)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Pentagon Pizza Index (PizzINT) is a real-time Pentagon pizza tracker that visualizes unusual activity at Pentagon-area pizzerias — an OSINT signal that has historically aligned with late-night, high-tempo operations and news cycles."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the Pentagon Pizza Theory real or accurate?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It's an OSINT signal with both historical anecdotes and modern, measurable traffic data. Spikes frequently coincide with elevated watch or major news — best interpreted alongside other context."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I read the dashboard and DOUGHCON levels?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Watch the DOUGHCON display, active spikes, and the overall index. \"Busier than usual\" patterns, sustained late-night activity, and multi-location surges are higher-signal events."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What data sources does PizzINT use and how often is it updated?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We use publicly available signals like Google Maps Popular Times compared to historical baselines. Data typically updates about every 10 minutes."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I cite, embed, or support PizzINT?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Please cite PizzINT.watch as the source. For media or research, contact ads.pizzint@gmail.com. If this project helps you, consider buying us a slice on Ko-fi."}}]}</script></div></div><div class="hidden lg:block"></div><div class="border-t border-gray-800"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 sm:py-8"><div class="text-center"><button class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 sm:px-6 py-2 sm:py-3 bg-blue-900/50 border border-blue-500 rounded-lg text-blue-400 hover:bg-blue-900 transition-all transform hover:scale-105 font-mono text-sm sm:text-base">↑ RETURN TO LIVE INTELLIGENCE</button></div><div class="mt-8 sm:mt-12 bg-red-900/20 border border-red-600 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-alert w-5 h-5 sm:w-6 sm:h-6 text-red-400 flex-shrink-0 sm:mt-1" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="16" y2="16"></line></svg><div><h4 class="text-red-400 font-bold mb-2 text-sm sm:text-base">OPERATIONAL DISCLAIMER</h4><p class="text-gray-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">This dashboard is for informational and educational purposes only. Data correlation does not imply causation. Pizza consumption patterns should not be used as a basis for financial, political, or strategic decisions. Always monitor the pizzas responsibly. 🍕</p></div></div></div></div></div><footer class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-slate-800 bg-black text-white"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-red-500/50"></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-10 pt-14 sm:px-6 sm:pb-12 sm:pt-16 lg:px-8"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1.8fr] lg:gap-16"><div><p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-red-400/85">Live OSINT dashboard</p><h2 class="mt-4 max-w-xl font-mono text-2xl font-black leading-tight text-slate-50 sm:text-3xl">Pentagon Pizza Watch tracks public signals, prediction markets, and geopolitical events in one watch screen.</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-lg text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Follow pizza activity near the Pentagon, live intelligence briefs, Polyglobe map layers, election markets, and other open-source indicators built for people who refresh when the world gets weird.</p><div class="mt-7 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-red-400/40 bg-red-500/10 px-5 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-red-100 transition hover:border-red-300 hover:bg-red-500/20" href="/polyglobe">Open Polyglobe</a><a href="https://ko-fi.com/pizzintwatch" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-yellow-300/30 bg-yellow-300/10 px-5 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-yellow-100 transition hover:border-yellow-200 hover:bg-yellow-300/20">Support PizzINT</a></div></div><div class="space-y-8"><a href="mailto:ads.pizzint@gmail.com" class="group block rounded-xl border border-red-400/50 bg-red-500 px-5 py-4 text-black transition hover:border-red-300 hover:bg-red-400 sm:px-6 sm:py-5"><span class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-[0.12em] sm:text-2xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail h-6 w-6 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7"></path><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect></svg><span>Contact Us</span></span><span class="mt-2 block max-w-2xl text-sm font-semibold leading-5 text-black/75">Send tips, partnership ideas, ad inquiries, or data sources for the watch desk.</span></a><div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3"><div><h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-slate-300">Watch</h3><nav class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm" aria-label="Footer watch links"><a class="font-mono text-slate-400 transition hover:text-white" href="/polyglobe">Polyglobe Live Map</a><a class="font-mono text-slate-400 transition hover:text-white" href="/electionhub">Election Hub</a><a class="font-mono text-slate-400 transition hover:text-white" href="/nothingeverhappens">Nothing Ever Happens Index</a><a class="font-mono text-slate-400 transition hover:text-white" href="/hormuz">Hormuz Transit Watch</a></nav></div><div><h3 class="font-