g\":null,\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/china-invades-taiwan-in-2025-CCSd9dX2mrea.jpg\",\"volume\":2095484.7417809993,\"volume_24h\":5095.267933,\"endDate\":1790830799999}],\"lowVolume\":[{\"slug\":\"insurrection-act-invoked-by-september-30\",\"label\":\"Insurrection Act invoked by September 30?\",\"region\":\"global\",\"price\":0.0195,\"tokenId\":\"50257103245948694561672945033998860624135214569088138001929168928144587289835\",\"seriesId\":null,\"eventId\":\"145985\",\"eventSlug\":null,\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/trump-invokes-the-insurrection-act-before-august-jR3s2WWoaIbY.jpg\",\"volume\":34.19,\"volume_24h\":0,\"endDate\":1790830799999}],\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T20:14:36.530Z\"},\"championMarketUrl\":\"https://polymarket.com/market/uptspt-anti-cartel-operation-outside-of-the-uptspt-by-september-30-20260810131538351?utm_source=pizzint.watch\u0026utm_medium=main-dashboard\u0026utm_content=uptspt-anti-cartel-operation-outside-of-the-uptspt-by-september-30-20260810131538351\",\"initialTweets\":[{\"id\":\"2097423090611294504\",\"text\":\"Iran launched a second, previously undisclosed attack on U.S. Navy ships Monday after weekend missile attacks targeting an aircraft carrier and destroyer. No U.S. ships were hit. - WSJ\\n\\nU.S. officials are increasingly concerned that Iran may be using more advanced missile\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/conflict_radar/status/2097423090611294504\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T20:33:27+00:00\",\"handle\":\"conflict_radar\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097422695545663868\",\"text\":\"A second tanker has been struck off the coast of Jask, bringing the total number of Iranian tankers hit to four. https://t.co/aNSanePG2q\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osintwarfare/status/2097422695545663868\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T20:31:53+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osintwarfare\",\"isAlert\":false,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097420718136799515\",\"text\":\"Iran's military command has threatened to attack oil tankers at ports in Kuwait and Bahrain, warning crews to abandon their vessels https://t.co/WmpnrFfhnx\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osinttechnical/status/2097420718136799515\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T20:24:02+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osinttechnical\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097419946733285404\",\"text\":\"This comes after reports that the US attacked two Iranian tankers near Kharg Island and another off the coast of Jaks. https://t.co/ZuEZRnF7x7 https://t.co/JJvjpJzQAy\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/conflict_radar/status/2097419946733285404\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T20:20:58+00:00\",\"handle\":\"conflict_radar\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097419757943140392\",\"text\":\"Iran has warned all tankers in port and at offshore berthing points in Kuwait and Bahrain that retaliatory strikes against them are imminent, with a commensurate warning to mariners that the U.S. gave prior to strikes on Iranian tankers just earlier. https://t.co/B0UV15Ssdl\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/sentdefender/status/2097419757943140392\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T20:20:13+00:00\",\"handle\":\"sentdefender\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097419288931873167\",\"text\":\"The cameraman should be fired. https://t.co/JRMNJ11B6u\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osintwarfare/status/2097419288931873167\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T20:18:21+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osintwarfare\",\"isAlert\":false,\"hasMatch\":false,\"matchQuality\":null,\"isGeotagged\":false,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097419112842702888\",\"text\":\"The Wall Street Journal reports that Iran launched a second, previously undisclosed attack on U.S. Navy ships Monday, following weekend ballistic missile attacks against a U.S. aircraft carrier and guided-missile destroyer. No U.S. ships were hit, but the repeated attacks are https://t.co/Yql5YPmikP\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/sentdefender/status/2097419112842702888\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T20:17:39+00:00\",\"handle\":\"sentdefender\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097412669426770364\",\"text\":\"German AfD co-leader Tino Chrupalla on Ukraine: \\\"We are producing drones in Germany that are being used to launch attacks into the Russian hinterland, and we reject that. We have always said, and this is also in our party program, no arms deliveries to crisis regions and war\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/polymarketintel/status/2097412669426770364\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T19:52:03+00:00\",\"handle\":\"polymarketintel\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097412091778887694\",\"text\":\"The U.S. military struck Iranian oil tankers near Kharg Island and the port city of Jask, senior U.S. officials told Fox News, calling it part of a wider effort to hit Iran economically.\\n\\nIranian state media reports three Iranian crude carriers were struck. CENTCOM said the\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/polymarketintel/status/2097412091778887694\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T19:49:45+00:00\",\"handle\":\"polymarketintel\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097411556082332143\",\"text\":\"The CIA’s headquarters in Riyadh was effectively destroyed, while several U.S. military bases in the region sustained extensive damage.\\n\\nThe U.S. Navy’s top admiral also said personnel will not be returning to Bahrain “anytime soon.” - CNN\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osintwarfare/status/2097411556082332143\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T19:47:37+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osintwarfare\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097410244892586126\",\"text\":\"More information from Fox News’ @JenGriffinFN on ongoing U.S. strikes, again confirming that Iranian tankers are being targeted. Per a senior U.S. official, via Griffin, said strikes are subordinate to upscaled U.S. efforts to beggar Iran’s economy. https://t.co/vzzWfZ61ky\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/sentdefender/status/2097410244892586126\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T19:42:25+00:00\",\"handle\":\"sentdefender\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097409465121444145\",\"text\":\"Reports are emerging from Iranian state media that U.S. forces have struck three Iranian oil tankers, following the earlier U.S. announcement that three Iranian crude carriers were disabled or destroyed on September 5. CENTCOM said the strikes were carried out after Iran launched https://t.co/BIt5QuQlcB\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/sentdefender/status/2097409465121444145\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T19:39:19+00:00\",\"handle\":\"sentdefender\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097407689005375924\",\"text\":\"Iranian state media reports that an Iranian oil tanker was attacked by US forces near Kharg Island moments ago. \\n\\nThe tanker was reportedly hit by an American missile in the Kharg Island anchorage. https://t.co/jNrXqbUKSN\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osinttechnical/status/2097407689005375924\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T19:32:15+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osinttechnical\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097406954024919190\",\"text\":\"A U.S. official has now confirmed to The Jerusalem Post that airstrikes are currently underway against Iranian oil tankers. \\nMore to come. https://t.co/rQIdpaT7Yl\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/sentdefender/status/2097406954024919190\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T19:29:20+00:00\",\"handle\":\"sentdefender\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097406774865248451\",\"text\":\"Iran's military command says US forces have warned Iranian tanker crews to evacuate before their vessels are attacked.\\n\\nIran says it will respond to any strikes on its tankers by attacking US bases in the region.\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osinttechnical/status/2097406774865248451\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T19:28:37+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osinttechnical\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097406043722547491\",\"text\":\"Iran's military command says US forces have ordered Iranian tanker crews to evacuate ahead of planned strikes. \\n\\nIran says it will respond to any attacks on its tankers by attacking US bases in the region.\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osinttechnical/status/2097406043722547491\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T19:25:43+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osinttechnical\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097404639800918414\",\"text\":\"Several explosions have been heard in the vicinity of Iran’s Kharg Island, amidst reports of U.S. airstrikes along the coast of Iran. https://t.co/O7GRgVJXon\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/sentdefender/status/2097404639800918414\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T19:20:08+00:00\",\"handle\":\"sentdefender\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097404490823487744\",\"text\":\"Two Iranian tankers have been struck off Kharg Island, while a third was hit near Jask.\\n\\nAn Iranian retaliatory response is expected within the next few hours.\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osintwarfare/status/2097404490823487744\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T19:19:33+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osintwarfare\",\"isAlert\":false,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097403283790836115\",\"text\":\"The IRGC claims it captured a U.S. undersea drone in the Strait of Hormuz.\\n\\nCENTCOM: the AUV malfunctioned over a day ago, was an older model, carried no classified equipment and collected no sensitive data. Operations continue. https://t.co/JFuj8ZLez3\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/polymarketintel/status/2097403283790836115\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T19:14:45+00:00\",\"handle\":\"polymarketintel\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097400647968547033\",\"text\":\"The commander of Iran's Khatam al-Anbiya Central Headquarters: Any attack on Iranian oil tankers will result in U.S. bases across the region being targeted.\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/polymarketintel/status/2097400647968547033\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T19:04:16+00:00\",\"handle\":\"polymarketintel\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097400408075313629\",\"text\":\"Several explosions heard near the Kharg Island anchorage in Iran, according to Mehr News. No official information on the cause or possible damage.\\n\\nStrong blasts were also reported on Jask Island.\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/polymarketintel/status/2097400408075313629\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T19:03:19+00:00\",\"handle\":\"polymarketintel\",\"isAlert\":false,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097395804436590753\",\"text\":\"Early reports from both Tasnim and other local outlets have claimed that the U.S. may be targeting additional Iranian tankers in the Strait of Hormuz. https://t.co/5Umv0lJoN1\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/sentdefender/status/2097395804436590753\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T18:45:02+00:00\",\"handle\":\"sentdefender\",\"isAlert\":false,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097394004685930530\",\"text\":\"Despite countless other USVs and AUVs continuing to operate in the CENTCOM AOR, Iranian Parliament Speaker Mohammad Bagher Ghalibaf laughably shares an image claiming to have “knocked out” the U.S.’s unmanned surface and subsurface capabilities in the region. Note how the only https://t.co/sS0T37qQR7\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/sentdefender/status/2097394004685930530\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T18:37:53+00:00\",\"handle\":\"sentdefender\",\"isAlert\":false,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097393014997930377\",\"text\":\"Additional information below on the U.S. AUV captured by Iran. Per a CENTCOM official speaking to @KellieMeyerNews, “The defective drone was an older model that neither collected sensitive data nor carried any classified sonar or radar equipment. U.S. operations in area waters https://t.co/M8NNPBVbkd https://t.co/9FVVmHbR4W\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/sentdefender/status/2097393014997930377\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T18:33:57+00:00\",\"handle\":\"sentdefender\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097392152070275376\",\"text\":\"Today, three major packages of PATRIOT missiles for Ukraine were announced:\\n\\n- The EU will fund €3.2 billion for interceptor purchases.\\n- The UK will provide £100 million for PURL to purchase interceptors.\\n- Germany will directly deliver PAC-2 missiles from Bundeswehr stocks. https://t.co/3Vxpy5QK9w\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osinttechnical/status/2097392152070275376\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T18:30:31+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osinttechnical\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":false,\"matchQuality\":null,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097391054324371697\",\"text\":\"Additional images showing the U.S. Dive-LD AUV that was captured by the Iranians, following what a U.S. official described as a malfunction a number of days ago. https://t.co/fyuDFJxsuv\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/sentdefender/status/2097391054324371697\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T18:26:09+00:00\",\"handle\":\"sentdefender\",\"isAlert\":false,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097390804243222658\",\"text\":\"The IRGC Navy launched two anti-ship cruise missiles toward vessels in the Strait of Hormuz.\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osintwarfare/status/2097390804243222658\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T18:25:10+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osintwarfare\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097387301215027460\",\"text\":\"Iran has released the first footage showing the captured U.S. Navy Dive-LD autonomous underwater vehicle (AUV). https://t.co/9GlFaJhbec https://t.co/sCdTnovE97\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osintwarfare/status/2097387301215027460\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T18:11:14+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osintwarfare\",\"isAlert\":false,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097385788077989994\",\"text\":\"According to Reuters, following the IRGC’s claim that a U.S. Autonomous Underwater Vehicle (AUV) was captured near the Strait of Hormuz, a U.S. official has said that an AUV did in fact malfunction more than a day ago. https://t.co/2HM0EbY2PU\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/sentdefender/status/2097385788077989994\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T18:05:14+00:00\",\"handle\":\"sentdefender\",\"isAlert\":false,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097384808833847555\",\"text\":\"Reuters, citing a U.S. official, reported that a U.S. military unmanned underwater vehicle (UUV) malfunctioned in the Middle East more than 24 hours ago. https://t.co/sCdTnovE97\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osintwarfare/status/2097384808833847555\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T18:01:20+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osintwarfare\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097379821479161947\",\"text\":\"The head of Rossotrudnichestvo, Igor Chaika, attempted to downplay Russia's deteriorating relationship with Armenia today, but admitted that \\\"there are ups and downs.\\\"\\n\\nThe admission comes as Russia's influence in the Caucasus wanes due to the war in Ukraine. https://t.co/uBkQtsS5Xl\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osinttechnical/status/2097379821479161947\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T17:41:31+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osinttechnical\",\"isAlert\":false,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097379486039699823\",\"text\":\"A warehouse is on fire in Bila Tserkva, Kyiv Oblast, following a Geran-2/4 drone strike. https://t.co/iiom8ieY2r\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osintwarfare/status/2097379486039699823\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T17:40:11+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osintwarfare\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097374809130672391\",\"text\":\"The IRGC has released footage showing the interception of a U.S. Army MQ-1C Gray Eagle unmanned combat aerial vehicle (UCAV) over the Strait of Hormuz. https://t.co/5sMGBqzRRp https://t.co/ytcvz4Dh22\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osintwarfare/status/2097374809130672391\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T17:21:36+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osintwarfare\",\"isAlert\":false,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097372013438382529\",\"text\":\"Per the Saudi Directorate of Civil Defense, the danger has also passed for Najran. https://t.co/mxND1ZRjjX\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/sentdefender/status/2097372013438382529\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T17:10:29+00:00\",\"handle\":\"sentdefender\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097371495806668944\",\"text\":\"Per the Saudi Directorate of Civil Defense, the danger has also passed from the alert for Abha as well. https://t.co/qgL3yN8rVG\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/sentdefender/status/2097371495806668944\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T17:08:26+00:00\",\"handle\":\"sentdefender\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097371113328165032\",\"text\":\"Ansar Allah forces launched a multi-axis attack against areas of Al-Wazi'iyah District, southwest of Taiz.\\n\\nDespite Saudi airstrikes, the forces seized control within hours of the Al-Wazi'iyah–Mocha (Al-Mukha) road, along with the areas of Al-Hinayah (Al-Hanaya), Al-Aqama, and https://t.co/1v3wt3g08X\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osintwarfare/status/2097371113328165032\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T17:06:55+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osintwarfare\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097370827737960868\",\"text\":\"Amidst ongoing Houthi strikes against Saudi energy infrastructure and civilian targets, a number of alerts have been issued for the Jazan, Abha, and Najran areas of Saudi Arabia, with recent updates indicating that the alerts from Jazan have now been lifted. https://t.co/1zETgxmZpD\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/sentdefender/status/2097370827737960868\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T17:05:47+00:00\",\"handle\":\"sentdefender\",\"isAlert\":true,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097369311329275975\",\"text\":\"Iran's Navy claims it seized an \\\"advanced US unmanned underwater vessel\\\" in the Strait of Hormuz.\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/polymarketintel/status/2097369311329275975\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T16:59:45+00:00\",\"handle\":\"polymarketintel\",\"isAlert\":false,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097356615980548463\",\"text\":\"The IRGC Navy says it seized a U.S. unmanned underwater vehicle (UUV) at the entrance to the Strait of Hormuz and released images of the craft. https://t.co/3yEf8LzKRM\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/conflict_radar/status/2097356615980548463\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T16:09:18+00:00\",\"handle\":\"conflict_radar\",\"isAlert\":false,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]},{\"id\":\"2097351918444056982\",\"text\":\"Iranian forces claim to have captured an American Anduril Dive-LD Autonomous Undersea Vehicle near the Strait of Hormuz today. \\n\\nComes as the US works to clear the strait of underwater mines. https://t.co/CYusq6myxR\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/osinttechnical/status/2097351918444056982\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T15:50:38+00:00\",\"handle\":\"osinttechnical\",\"isAlert\":false,\"hasMatch\":true,\"matchQuality\":0.95,\"isGeotagged\":true,\"media\":[],\"media_full\":[]}],\"initialDashboardData\":{\"success\":true,\"data\":[{\"place_id\":\"ChIJcYireCe3t4kR4d9trEbGYjc\",\"name\":\"Extreme Pizza\",\"address\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Extreme+Pizza/@38.8602396,-77.0585603,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89b7b72778ab8871:0x3762c646ac6ddfe1!8m2!3d38.8602396!4d-77.0559854!16s%2Fg%2F12llsn19l?entry=ttu\u0026g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDYxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\",\"current_popularity\":83,\"percentage_of_usual\":160,\"is_spike\":true,\"spike_magnitude\":\"HIGH\",\"data_source\":\"live\",\"recorded_at\":\"2026-09-08T19:07:36.424+00:00\",\"data_freshness\":\"fresh\",\"sparkline_24h\":[{\"place_id\":\"ChIJcYireCe3t4kR4d9trEbGYjc\",\"current_popularity\":15,\"recorded_at\":\"20